      "code": "import asyncio\n\nasyncio.run(main())        # 必须显式启动 —— 没有它会报\n                         #        \"no running event loop\"\n\nasync def main():\n    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n    task = asyncio.create_task(work())     # 排进循环\n    await task\n\n# ⚠ 事件循环里跑同步阻塞代码会**堵住整个循环**：\n#   time.sleep(1)         -> 谁都别想动\n#   await asyncio.sleep(1) -> 让出控制权\n# 同步库（requests、psycopg2）放进协程里就是这个效果",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">asyncio</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">run</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">main</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">())</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        # 必须显式启动 —— 没有它会报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                         #        \"no running event loop\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">async</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> main</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    loop </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> asyncio</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">get_running_loop</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    task </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> asyncio</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">create_task</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">work</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">())</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">     # 排进循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    await</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># ⚠ 事件循环里跑同步阻塞代码会**堵住整个循环**：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">#   time.sleep(1)         -> 谁都别想动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">#   await asyncio.sleep(1) -> 让出控制权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 同步库（requests、psycopg2）放进协程里就是这个效果</span></span></code></pre>",
