      "code": "task = asyncio.create_task(work())\n\ntask.cancel()                 # 真取消：在下一个 await 点抛 CancelledError\ntry:\n    await task\nexcept asyncio.CancelledError:\n    raise                     # ⚠ 接住之后要再抛，别把它吞掉\n\n# 超时是一种取消\nawait asyncio.wait_for(work(), timeout=5)\n\n# 清理写在 finally 里 —— 取消也会经过它\nasync def work():\n    try:\n        ...\n    finally:\n        await cleanup()",
